  "Assets for the 3D view": "3D 视图所需数据",
  "To show the match in 3D, this observer uses the game's own models, textures, animations and sounds. It downloads them from this server as the match needs them and keeps them in your browser's storage. Your next match or visit then reuses them instead of downloading them again.": "为了以 3D 显示比赛，此观察器使用游戏自带的模型、纹理、动画和声音。它会在比赛需要时从此服务器下载这些内容，并保存在您浏览器的存储中。您的下一场比赛或下次访问会重复使用它们，而不是再次下载。",
  "Over time this observer may store up to <b>{size}</b> of data on your machine.": "随着时间推移，此观察器最多可能在您的电脑上存储 <b>{size}</b> 的数据。",
  "You don't need to wait for any of it. The match starts right away, and each model is fetched the first time it comes on screen. It shows first as a small rough version of a few KB, and full detail follows. A lower texture quality in the settings stores less.": "您无需等待其中任何一项。比赛会立即开始，每个模型在首次出现在屏幕上时才会获取。它先显示为只有几 KB 的小而粗糙的版本，随后是完整细节。在设置中降低纹理质量可减少存储量。",
  "<b>Warm up</b> downloads, in the background, everything this match can need: the buildings and units of every civilisation in it, the map's terrain, and the trees, animals and rocks on it. Then nothing has to load when it first appears. This helps on a slow connection, or before the armies meet. It also asks your browser to keep these files rather than clear them when space runs low, and some browsers will ask your permission first.": "<b>预加载</b>会在后台下载这场比赛可能需要的一切：其中每个文明的建筑和单位、地图的地形，以及地图上的树木、动物和岩石。这样它们首次出现时就无需再加载。这在网速较慢时或军队交战之前很有帮助。它还会请求浏览器保留这些文件，而不是在空间不足时清除，部分浏览器会先征求您的许可。",
  "You can delete the stored files at any time in your browser's site data settings.": "您可以随时在浏览器的网站数据设置中删除已存储的文件。",
